### Component 4: Prompt Engineering

#### Asset Style Analysis (từ sample assets đã quan sát)

| Thuộc tính | Quan sát |
|---|---|
| Art style | Semi-realistic cartoon game art, smooth gradients, glossy shading |
| Color palette | Deep purple/gold (Background), Sky blue + Gold border (Frames), Vivid multicolor (Balls) |
| Camera view | Front-facing characters, straight-on for UI elements |
| Lighting | Soft ambient light, subtle inner glow on buttons/balls |
| Background | Transparent PNG cho assets, full-scene cho backgrounds |
| Detail level | High detail on characters, medium-high on UI elements |

#### Prompt Structure Template
```
[Subject], [Style: semi-realistic cartoon game art, smooth cel-shading],
[Palette: specific hex colors], [Lighting: soft ambient light, inner glow],
[Composition: centered, front-facing], [Technical: transparent background, 512x512,
game-asset-ready, high detail]
```

#### Asset Types cần generate (≥3 iterations mỗi loại)
1. **New Character** — khác gender/trang phục so với mẫu, cùng style
2. **New Bingo Balls** — màu mới (Orange/Pink/Teal), cùng glossy style
3. **UI Button** — variant màu mới (Green/Purple), cùng gold-border frame
4. **Bingo Card Frame** — variant mới (Red-themed), cùng style
5. **Background Scene** — stage scene mới, cùng theatrical lighting palette

